---
layout: layouts/main.njk
title: Blog
---

<h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ title }}</h1>
<p class="blog-description">This is a space where I write about front-end technologies, the frictions between design and
    engineering, and some of my hobbies.
    <a class="mdf-link" href="/blog.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
<ul class="blog-post-list">
    {% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
        <li class="blog-post-list-item">
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-post-list-item-link">
                <div class="blog-post-list-item-title" style="view-transition-name: {{ post.data.title | toTransitionNamePost }}">{{ post.data.title }}</div>
                <div class="blog-post-list-item-date mdf-muted">{{ post.date | date }}</div>
            </a>
        </li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>